Package: iato
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Dhruv Setty <91457220+whatheheckisthis@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, libssl3 | libssl3t64, ca-certificates
Recommends: sssd (>= 2.11.0), sssd-idp, libnss-sss, libpam-sss, sssd-tools
Suggests: azure-cli
Homepage: https://github.com/whatheheckisthis/Intent-Auditable-Trust-Object-V2
Description: Intent-Auditable Trust Object V2: Entra ID sign in for Debian
 iato registers an Entra ID application through Microsoft Graph, renders and
 checks sssd.conf for the SSSD idp provider, installs SSSD (pinning it from
 Debian forky on bookworm and trixie), and verifies that Entra users resolve
 and may log in with the OAuth 2.0 Device Authorization Grant.
